  } ],
  "http://purl.org/phmo#hasText" : [ {
    "@value" : "The hybrid Bayesian network classified Atieno's AF risk as present on 10 July 2026, with a calibrated probability of 0.64 against a decision threshold of 0.053. Hypertension is the input state that distinguishes this result from AF risk absent; it is an established risk factor for AF in the 2024 ESC guidelines for the management of AF."
