    "@id" : "https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "seca Scale-up Line measuring station"
  } ],
